      text: <p><span style="color:#1E2761;font-size:15px;font-weight:700">X 型双分支结构 · 五大组成部分</span></p>
    sourceLayout: 3349bdb139cea88f77337c415d8c500389cfc6ba08ce3f22a030e2a3cad44f7f
  - elementId: slide-6-node-154-Text-8
    elementType: text
    bounds:
      - 50.4
      - 147.6
      - 410.4
      - 345.6
    content:
      fontFamily: Calibri
      fontSize: 12
      color: '#0D9488'
      align:
        - left
        - top
      wrap: true
      text: '<p><span style="color:#0D9488;font-size:12px;font-family:Calibri;font-weight:700">1) Encoder (双分支编码器)</span></p><p><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:11px;font-family:Calibri">    ResNet50 提取局部纹理与条纹边缘; Swin-Tiny 提供窗口上下文与长程依赖。多尺度融合后经 FFC 瓶颈与 HighFrequencyEnhancement 输出 5 路特征 (x_bb_1..4 + x_c)。</span></p><p><span style="color:#000000;font-size:4px;font-family:Calibri"> </span></p><p><span style="color:#DB2777;font-size:12px;font-family:Calibri;font-weight:700">2) GradientDecoder (梯度辅助解码器)</span></p><p><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:11px;font-family:Calibri">    从编码特征解码 5 个 Block, 得到 4 个中间特征 xe1..xe4, 并通过两个独立输出头给出梯度图 g 与高反光软概率 s。</span></p><p><span style="color:#000000;font-size:4px;font-family:Calibri"> </span></p><p><span style="color:#10B981;font-size:12px;font-family:Calibri;font-weight:700">3) EnhancementLayers (增强桥接)</span></p><p><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:11px;font-family:Calibri">    把 xe1..xe4 与 g、原图 x 和 s 一起送入 4 个 _SpectralDecompositionUnit, 输出 4 级增强特征 enh1..enh4 给主解码器。</span></p><p><span style="color:#000000;font-size:4px;font-family:Calibri"> </span></p><p><span style="color:#7C3AED;font-size:12px;font-family:Calibri;font-weight:700">4) MainDecoder (主解码器)</span></p><p><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:11px;font-family:Calibri">    5 级解码: 编码 skip + 增强特征 + 三路先验门控 + SpecularAwareAttention。共享解码主体之后分成两个头: b (高反光) 与 r_direct (直接漫反射), 并预测 alpha_logit。</span></p><p><span style="color:#000000;font-size:4px;font-family:Calibri"> </span></p><p><span style="color:#F59E0B;font-size:12px;font-family:Calibri;font-weight:700">5) 双路融合 + ResidualRefinementHead</span></p><p><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:11px;font-family:Calibri">    r_sub = clamp(x − b); α = sigmoid(alpha_logit); r_fused = α·r_direct + (1−α)·r_sub; 最终 r = clamp(r_fused + 0.15·Δ)。</span></p>'
    sourceLayout: afe927a0d4517cdb718c6bf4c04cfb2ed51f6b838ed010c68ddc27b598358793
